Two traps that have burned this exact rail: a zero-case sweep passes vacuously, and a matrix whose assertion is already answered by an earlier guard is unfalsifiable no matter what the denominator says. Also, if a roster's arms are scanned by more than one scanner, grep the one the arms actually execute — grepping the wrong scanner yields a false zero.

